{"screen_name": "tohma", "file": "tohma-6687cb", "name": "𝙩𝙤𝙝𝙢𝙖", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1676070018084376577/_IqlMPWy.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1369083224522072067/1691824530/1500x500", "description": "life and music / https://linktr.ee/tohmacps / https://skeb.jp/@tohma / tohk @kasaitakara / icon @mika46837107", "total_works": 98, "scraped_works": 30, "first_seen": "2026-03-20T21:09:38.662955+00:00", "last_updated": "2026-03-20T21:09:38.662955+00:00", "price_history": {"music": [{"amount": 8500, "recorded_at": "2026-03-20T21:09:38.662955+00:00"}]}, "current_prices": {"music": 8500}, "price_range": {"music": {"min": 8500, "max": 8500}}, "links": [{"label": "Twitter", "url": "https://x.com/tohma_cps", "name": "tohma_cps"}, {"label": "Website", "url": "https://linktr.ee/tohmacps", "name": ""}], "flags": {}, "acceptable": true, "works": [{"path": "/@tohma/works/98", "thumbnail_src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1676070018084376577%2F_IqlMPWy.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9fad5a0da8a86abbf8f07cba166806d1", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1676070018084376577%2F_IqlMPWy.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9fad5a0da8a86abbf8f07cba166806d1, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1676070018084376577%2F_IqlMPWy.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b309566395086025070ab65b45e79a08 2x, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1676070018084376577%2F_IqlMPWy.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7660158e840a30982521d66ae27f37d4 3x", "genre": "music", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、tohmaです！あなたの作品が大好きで、私のVtuberのためにBGMをお願いしたいのです。\n彼女は様々な惑星を旅している天狐で、地球に興味を持つようになります。彼女は心優しく、好奇心旺盛ですが、不器用です。\n\nハッピーで、リラックスできて、気分が良くなるようなものを希望します！主にピアノをベースにしてほしい！ストリーミングしながら使えるように、ループも欲しいです。トークをするのが難しくないけど、それだけで美しく聞こえるようなもの。\n\nありがとう！あなたが素敵にやっていることを願っています <3\n\nキャラクター\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/175p-b-OYLduceDGh7syibpzdKnJXRltZ?usp=sharing\n\n参考文献\nhttps://skeb.jp/@tohma/works/64\nhttps://skeb.jp/@tohma/works/76\nhttps://skeb.jp/@You_uta1/works/118\nhttps://skeb.jp/@You_uta1/works/128\nhttps://skeb.jp/@sippomugi3/works/3", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@tohma/works/97", "thumbnail_src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1676070018084376577%2F_IqlMPWy.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=70e53ba737506fe86aeb572be78cb4e6", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1676070018084376577%2F_IqlMPWy.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=70e53ba737506fe86aeb572be78cb4e6, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1676070018084376577%2F_IqlMPWy.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=48f5b981ad3bc7cdc068b15727eb1861 2x, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1676070018084376577%2F_IqlMPWy.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=c1cde13a31b484773f39bd36eb11db34 3x", "genre": "music", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@tohma/works/96", "thumbnail_src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https